  "item_short_desc": "<p>Keep your child cozy all winter with Rothco's Insulated Kids Coveralls. These coveralls are crafted from durable poly/cotton fabric and feature poly fiberfill insulation to ensure warmth in cold and snowy conditions. The 2-way zipper from the crotch to the neck allows for easy on/off, while the storm flap helps keep the elements out. Zippered legs from the bottom to the knee make it easy to fit over snow boots. With 2 front slash pockets and 1 breast pocket, there's plenty of room to store essentials.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "1043",
  "description": "<p>Keep your child cozy all winter with Rothco's Insulated Kids Coveralls. These coveralls are crafted from durable poly/cotton fabric and feature poly fiberfill insulation to ensure warmth in cold and snowy conditions. The 2-way zipper from the crotch to the neck allows for easy on/off, while the storm flap helps keep the elements out. Zippered legs from the bottom to the knee make it easy to fit over snow boots. With 2 front slash pockets and 1 breast pocket, there's plenty of room to store essentials. The self-collar design with no hood offers versatility, and elastic along the backside of the waist provides mobility and stretch for active kids. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
